{"hash_algorithm":"sha256","ts":"2026-11-20T11:44:46.491Z","author":"harness:claude-code","author_source":"detected","agent_harness":"claude-code","agent_model":"claude-opus-5-5","agent_model_source":"probe","agent_instance":"4b084a2f74dd44054f4b141a","agent_provenance":{"model":{"value":"claude-opus-5-5","source":"probe"},"effort":{"value":"xhigh","source":"environment"},"role":{"value":"implementer","source":"inferred","confidence":"medium","rule_version":"v2","evidence":["claim:pm-gh1664","claim:pm-gh1730","lineage:pm-gh1730","lineage:pm-u9d0","lineage:pm-doxj"]},"topic":{"value":"workset:pm-gh1664+pm-gh1730","source":"inferred","confidence":"medium","rule_version":"v2","evidence":["claim:pm-gh1664","claim:pm-gh1730","lineage:pm-gh1730","lineage:pm-u9d0","lineage:pm-doxj"]},"version":{"value":"2.1.329","source":"probe"}},"op":"create","patch":[{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/id","value":"pm-sew1dj"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/title","value":"A history entry whose agent_harness is not a string crashes pm activity --raw, provenance reads and pm context with unknown_error"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/description","value":"Found by the Codex review of the pm-gh1664 change on 2026-11-20 and reproduced against the released 2026.11.20 build: in a fresh tracker, a history stream holding one entry with agent_harness: 42 makes pm activity --raw --limit 3 --json exit 1 with code unknown_error (a TypeError, entry.agent_harness?.trim is not a function). resolveCanonicalHarness in src/sdk/history-provenance.ts called .trim() on any truthy recorded value, and runActivity applies compileHistoryProvenanceMatcher to every row even without a provenance filter, so one malformed row from an import, a hand edit or another writer took down every activity read that projects provenance, and the pm context activity section with it (it used runActivity before pm-gh1664). An unclassified TypeError is also the kind of crash that reaches Sentry as an unexpected fault. Duplicate check: searched agent_harness, provenance, non-string harness, trim crash and unknown_error activity; no item owns it."},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/type","value":"Issue"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/status","value":"open"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/priority","value":2},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/tags","value":["activity","crash","history","provenance","robustness","sentry"]},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/created_at","value":"2026-11-20T11:44:46.491Z"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/updated_at","value":"2026-11-20T11:44:46.491Z"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/author","value":"harness:claude-code"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/estimated_minutes","value":30},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/acceptance_criteria","value":"A recorded agent_harness that is not a string resolves as unresolved instead of throwing, for runActivity in every mode, readRecentActivity, provenance projection and summaries; pm activity --raw returns the malformed row; a spec reproduces the crash shape"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/parent","value":"pm-33cw"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/risk","value":"low"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/confidence","value":"high"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/severity","value":"medium"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/repro_steps","value":"pm init; write a history entry with agent_harness: 42 to .agents/pm/history/pm-x.jsonl; run pm activity --raw --limit 3 --json"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/expected_result","value":"A malformed provenance field is reported as unresolved provenance"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/actual_result","value":"pm activity --raw exits 1 with unknown_error (TypeError: agent_harness.trim is not a function)"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/affected_version","value":"2026.11.20"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/component","value":"activity"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/dependencies","value":[{"id":"pm-gh1664","kind":"discovered_from","created_at":"2026-11-20T11:44:46.491Z","author":"harness:claude-code","source_kind":"cli:create:dep","autho